title: "Supply Chain Design Notes"
abstract: "A practitioner-oriented learning resource covering demand and forecasting, network design and digital connectivity, sourcing and supplier execution, internal operations, master scheduling, MRP, capacity, inventory, quality, logistics, warehousing, fulfillment, transportation, international trade, reverse logistics, waste, and continuous improvement through original explanations, diagrams, datasets, knowledge checks, and integrated case studies."
